---
source: src/setup/mod.rs
expression: "plan(Profile::Dev)"
---
hpds setup --profile dev runs these 8 steps:
  1. r
       hpds install r
  2. quarto
       hpds install quarto (latest stable)
  3. uv
       hpds install uv (latest stable)
  4. gh
       hpds install gh (latest stable)
  5. rig
       hpds install rig
  6. tinytex
       hpds install tinytex
  7. togi
       hpds install togi (latest stable)
  8. git setup
       hpds git setup
